      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{628438678419120b708c6260|full_name}:  That is the issue, this was pushed to the public branch, I shouldn't be required to use a pre-release package on another branch. I turned that off to avoid these issues. So thus the bug report. Version miss match for beta level content on the master branch.\n\nEdit: clarification.",
