  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Migration fails when unity 2022.3.6f1 is already installed on the system. Old packages do not upgrade along with the package manager even for a blank test project. It fails at world package upgrade on my debug package project. Included are the Asset World Loader Debug project with just the default packages installed with one not installed community repo. \n\nMy guess is that the search string is looking for package 3.4.99 when the latest available is 3.4.2.\n\nAddendum: \n\n- Looks like beta level features on the beta branch of the creator companion were published to the public master branch and now nothing is migrating because it is waiting for content that is not published to the master branch yet.",
